  "scope": "Literal flag-filter and reversal execute the ordered sampled-edge list. The independent product-weighted Boolean law transports exactly to the original finite Bernoulli subset law, including loops and canonical typed encoding; actual-output failure is bounded by that same law. Coin generation, canonical input enumeration, repeated sampling and bit complexity remain separate."
